        "description": [
          {
            "@value": "In the 2nd edition of the PAM PAM CLUB we focus on forms of erotic art, performative acts of sensuality, questions about queer desire and (non-)desire and the connections between power, non-conformity, resilience and responsiveness:\n\nLascivious, vulnerable, slutty, political. From intimate dance performances to provocative wet dreams; Organized by cuties from the community for sweethearts of the community. We look forward to welcoming you to WUK on Saturday Night.\n\nNo homophobia. No transphobia. No whorephobia. Just fun.\n\nLet go and lose in CLUB PAM PAM.\n\nAdmission: 18+\n\nWith nat_assmann, Denise Kottlett, mater suspiriorum, devil of the divine slime, REY, Sunny, HOTgrl_2000, JOIE DE F:LLE, THAO, tbc. / Graphic design Dominik Schatz",
            "@language": "de"
          }
        ]
      }
